WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:07.002
The recent-activity view publishes completed
transactions from a defined six-month window That

00:00:07.029 --> 00:00:12.919
shared definition can support multiple retention
analyses It creates

00:00:12.932 --> 00:00:18.511
a smaller clearer interface than asking every report
author to repeat the transaction-status logic
